  "details": "After the recent update, objects using VRC Constraint experience positional jitter when moved. This issue occurs not only with mirrors but also in other contexts.\n\n----\n\nYou can observe the issue with this avatar:\n\navtr_e59ad73b-a8f3-48aa-99e2-cf795afd7aa4\n\nThis avatar is equipped with two traffic wands: one mounted on the shoulder and the other on a drone.\n\n- The traffic wand mounted on the shoulder does not jitter while mounted. However, jitter occurs when it is moved while being held in the hand.\n\n- The traffic wand mounted on the drone experiences jitter in its mounted state. However, there is no jitter when it is held in the hand.",
